The names for games archives that have upper case letters have been
renamed on 'uunet' to be completely lower case. Apparently upper
case letters screws up their mail server. Thus, the following
have been renamed:
	.../volume7/GB		->	.../volume7/gb
	.../volume8/GB2 	->	.../volume8/gb2
	.../volume8/NetHack3	->	.../volume8/nethack3
This only applies to the uunet archive; other archives remain
the same (as far as I know).

